  <!--原中文: '驱散目标所有的石肤术。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Dispels all instances of stoneskin maintained by this pawn.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Dispels all instances of stoneskin maintained by this pawn.-->
  <TM_DispelStoneskin.description>驱散目标所有的石肤术。</TM_DispelStoneskin.description>
