  <!-- Earth Sprites -->
  <!--原中文: '大地精灵', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Earth Sprites',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Earth Sprites-->
  <TM_EarthSprites.label>大地精灵</TM_EarthSprites.label>
  <!--原中文: '召唤大地精灵来改变地形。精灵以光点的形式出现，漫不经心的人很容易忽略它们，但它们是勤劳的劳动者，能够将岩石或石头分解成其基本成分，或增加土壤的丰富性和肥力。\n\n一旦召被唤，他们持续在土地上工作，甚至移动到附近地区，直到被地卜师解散。大地精灵只能理解一些基本指令，会随机移动到一个新的区域继续他们的工作;如果附近没有需要工作的区域，召唤将会结束。\n\n作为对他们努力的回报,大地精灵期望稳定而大量的法力供应。如果地卜师不能满足这个要求，大地精灵就会消失。每个地卜师只能请求一个大地精灵的帮助，不管他们有多少法力。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Calls forth earth sprites to transform the terrain. Sprites appear as flecks of light and can easily be missed by the inattentive, but they are diligent workers capable of breaking rock or stone down into its base component or increase the richness and fertility of soil. 
		
Once summoned, they will continue to work on the terrain, even moving to nearby area's, until dismissed by the geomancer. Earth sprites only understand basic instructions and will move randomly to a new area to continue their work; if no nearby area needs work, the summoning will end. If earth sprites are summoned into an area named "earth sprites" then they will only move to nearby cells within this area.

In exchange for their efforts, earth sprites expect a steady and substantial supply of mana. If the geomancer fails to meet this request, the earth sprites will fade away. Each geomancer can only request the help of a single earth sprite, regardless of how much mana they have.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Calls forth earth sprites to transform the terrain. Sprites appear as flecks of light and can easily be missed by the inattentive, but they are diligent workers capable of breaking rock or stone down into its base component or increase the richness and fertility of soil. 
		
Once summoned, they will continue to work on the terrain, even moving to nearby area's, until dismissed by the geomancer. Earth sprites only understand basic instructions and will move randomly to a new area to continue their work; if no nearby area needs work, the summoning will end. If earth sprites are summoned into an area named "earth sprites" then they will only move to nearby cells within this area.

In exchange for their efforts, earth sprites expect a steady and substantial supply of mana. If the geomancer fails to meet this request, the earth sprites will fade away. Each geomancer can only request the help of a single earth sprite, regardless of how much mana they have.-->
  <TM_EarthSprites.description>召唤大地精灵来改变地形。精灵以光点的形式出现，漫不经心的人很容易忽略它们，但它们是勤劳的劳动者，能够将岩石或石头分解成其基本成分，或增加土壤的丰富性和肥力。\n\n一旦召被唤，他们持续在土地上工作，甚至移动到附近地区，直到被地卜师解散。大地精灵只能理解一些基本指令，会随机移动到一个新的区域继续他们的工作;如果附近没有需要工作的区域，召唤将会结束。\n\n作为对他们努力的回报,大地精灵期望稳定而大量的法力供应。如果地卜师不能满足这个要求，大地精灵就会消失。每个地卜师只能请求一个大地精灵的帮助，不管他们有多少法力。</TM_EarthSprites.description>
  <!--原中文: '驱散大地精灵', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Dismiss Earth Sprites',更新于2026-02-14-->
