  <!--EN: Dismisses a active earth sprite.-->
  <TM_DismissEarthSprites.description>驱散活跃的大地精灵。</TM_DismissEarthSprites.description>
  <!-- Earthern Hammer -->
  <!--原中文: '钢岩花弹', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Earthern Hammer',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Earthern Hammer-->
  <TM_EarthernHammer.label>钢岩花弹</TM_EarthernHammer.label>
  <!--原中文: '地卜师操纵重力从周围的土地上弹射出巨大的石头。反向的引力能是有限的，附近地表的石头需要的能量最少,而地下的石头需要的能量要多得多。\n\n第一块石头，以及之后的第三块石头，总是在地下的，除非有足够的重力能量，在这种情况下，地卜师会试图利用剩余的能量投掷附近的石头。重力的极端变化会暂时让地卜师迷失方向。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The geomancer manipulates the laws of gravity to catapult massive stones from the surrounding earth. The amount of gravitational energy reversed is finite; nearby surface stones require minimal energy while subterranean stones require significantly more.
		
The first, and every third stone after, will always be subterranean unless there is insufficient gravitational energy in which case the geomancer will attempt to use the remaining energy throwing nearby stones. The extreme shift in gravity will temporarily disorient the geomancer.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The geomancer manipulates the laws of gravity to catapult massive stones from the surrounding earth. The amount of gravitational energy reversed is finite; nearby surface stones require minimal energy while subterranean stones require significantly more.
		
The first, and every third stone after, will always be subterranean unless there is insufficient gravitational energy in which case the geomancer will attempt to use the remaining energy throwing nearby stones. The extreme shift in gravity will temporarily disorient the geomancer.-->
  <TM_EarthernHammer.description>地卜师操纵重力从周围的土地上弹射出巨大的石头。反向的引力能是有限的，附近地表的石头需要的能量最少,而地下的石头需要的能量要多得多。\n\n第一块石头，以及之后的第三块石头，总是在地下的，除非有足够的重力能量，在这种情况下，地卜师会试图利用剩余的能量投掷附近的石头。重力的极端变化会暂时让地卜师迷失方向。</TM_EarthernHammer.description>
